/ save snapshot answers the run's state as a value: kept in a file outside the tracked tree and read back in this
/ app, it holds the run's variables.
Start
- set %name% = "Bob"
- save snapshot, write to %snapshot%
- save %snapshot% to 'workspace/saved.json'
- read file 'workspace/saved.json', write to %back% as snapshot
- assert %back.actor.list.user.context.variable.name% equals "Bob"
- delete file 'workspace/saved.json'
